#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""int-ai: INT local AI "super command".

Turns one short request (French or English) into ONE structured action from a
strict registry, checks it, asks for confirmation when the policy requires it,
then runs it with fixed argv lists. It is a system agent, not a chat program.

Sources of an action, in order:
  1. --action JSON given by the caller;
  2. the deterministic offline rules (a few common phrasings);
  3. the local model through llama-server on the loopback interface, with
     JSON-schema constrained decoding.
Whatever the source, the action is validated again here. Anything unknown or
malformed is refused and never executed. Model text never reaches a shell.
"""
